  "description" : "[h1]FFS Ammo Counter and Reload Patch[/h1]\n\nFFS is one of the most iconic and beloved weapon mods on the Starbound Workshop known for its incredibly detailed firearms and clever workarounds to the game’s engine limitations.\n\nHowever, while the mod is still fantastic, the original gameplay systems could feel a bit punishing in modern playthroughs. So I decided to update and streamline the experience while keeping the spirit of the mod fully intact.\n\n[hr][/hr]\n\n[h2]Changes[/h2]\n\n[list]\n[*] **Weapons now use ammunition instead of energy.**  \n    No more draining your entire energy bar just to fire your gun. Ammo is tracked per weapon.\n\n[*] **Drawing animations only play once.**  \n    Swap weapons freely without seeing the same animation over and over.\n\n[*] **Staged Reloading.**  \n    If you interrupt a reload, you’ll resume from where you left off instead of starting over.\n\n[*] **Movement penalties removed.**  \n    Keep your mobility while firing and reloading.\n\n[*] **Ammunition persists across weapon swaps.**  \n    Guns remember how much ammo they have left even when you switch to another weapon.\n[/list]\n\n[hr][/hr]\n\n[h2]To-Do[/h2]\n\n[list]\n[*] Patch compatibility for additional FFS addons.  \n    (Addons with custom LUA currently still use the original energy-based system.)\n\n[*] A custom UI element to display ammo count.\n\n[*] True persistence across weapon slots.  \n    Currently, equipping the same gun in both hands treats them as separate ammo states.\n[/list]\n\n[hr][/hr]\n\n[h2]Notes[/h2]\nThis patch does not overwrite or break other FFS addons. The only limitation is that addons using their own LUA logic will still use the old energy mechanics until individually patched.\n\n[hr][/hr]\n\nFeel free to report issues, suggest improvements, or share balance feedback. I want the final version of this patch to feel smooth, intuitive, and true to the original mod’s style just with less frustration compared to others guns.\n\n[hr][/hr]\n\nFeel free to try my other patches! :)\n\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3309722414] Futuristic Armory - Ammo and Reload System Version [/url]\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3309869048] Lyetzi's Gunners Mod Tweak - Ammo and Reload System [/url]\n\n\n",
